==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Zory]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Gobble]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[St. Dober]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Zroco]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**3 [[Gobble]]s spawn, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
**3 [[Zory|Zories]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
**1 [[Zir Zeal]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[Prof. Owlbrowley]]s spawn after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This is a pretty normal St. Dober stage with light support from [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]], Gobble, and Prof. Owlbrowley. Given that the enemies spawn on timers, feel free to prepare your wallet by using [[Phantom Cat (Rare Cat)|Bubble Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N107 (Rare Cat)|Cat Chief]] sparingly, while you try to deal with the infinite peons using [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]].

When you hit the base, you are greeted by St. Dober and dangerous support which you will want to wipe out as quickly as possible. To that end, make sure you hit the base with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] so that you can kill the Zroco and force a damage knockback out of the Gobble. Alongside support from [[Master of Mind Soractes (Special Cat)|Soractes]] as well as his Conjure, and the [[Ototo Corps#Thunderbolt|Thunderbolt]] Cannon, it should be very doable to completely rush down most of St. Dober's health. Bahamut's Explosion should also be able to kill the Gobble with relative ease. Once Bahamut goes down, keep spamming Bubbles alongside support from a [[Talents|Talented]] [[Li'l Lizard Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l King Dragon Cat]] and St. Dober should go down quickly. Once he's dead, just make sure the Zories, or maybe the Zir Zeal if you took too long, stay dead for good with [[Ancient Egg: N107 (Rare Cat)|Cat Chief]], and you should be able to clear the stage.

